{"nodes": [{"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_workspace", "label": "Workspace with AI chat, Kanban board, and project plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan", "label": "01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Primary workspace screen (1728x1080): fixed left icon rail + top header, then a three-panel row \u2014 Chat (330px, left), Kanban board (center, flexible), Contexto (310px, right). Panels are separated by 1px dividers rather than cards, so the whole row reads as one continuous work surface."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_03_chat_oculto_kanban_expandido", "label": "03 \u00b7 Chat oculto \u2014 Kanban expandido", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Second exported screen of the same workspace with the chat panel hidden: the board gains width and the right panel is the Plan del proyecto instead of Contexto. Demonstrates the collapse/expand states of the panel layout."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_app_sidebar", "label": "App Sidebar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Icon-only rail (52px, bg #E7E7EA): app logo, dividers, nav Inicio / Proyectos / Tareas / Configuraci\u00f3n, spacer, user avatar with initials. The active destination (Nav Tareas) is the only item with a blue #007AFF fill, so current location is readable without labels; a hover tooltip ('Proyectos') supplies the missing text."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_project_selector", "label": "Project Selector", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_observatorio_regional", "label": "Observatorio Regional", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sample project used throughout the mock: 'El Observatorio Regional centraliza informaci\u00f3n de investigaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica de universidades de Centroam\u00e9rica'. Its domain (investigadores, organizaciones, investigaci\u00f3n) drives the demo task names."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_chat_panel", "label": "Chat Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Header is titled 'Chat con IA' and its subtitle defines the whole interaction model: 'Habla sobre tu proyecto, agrega tareas, pide planes o resuelve dudas.' \u2014 the chat is the conversational entry point for project work, not just a support widget. Left/right message bubbles distinguish user (blue, right, user avatar) from AI (grey, left, sparkles avatar)."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_propuesta_de_tareas", "label": "Propuesta de tareas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AI output is deliberately reviewable, not auto-applied: the card carries a count badge (6), a 'Pendiente' status chip, per-task checkboxes with grouped priority sections and nested subtasks, and ends in 'Descartar' vs 'Aplicar 6 tareas'. Nothing reaches the board without an explicit user action (human-in-the-loop). A compact single-task variant with 'Agregar' exists for follow-up proposals."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_chat_composer", "label": "Chat Composer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Attach button + text field + blue send button in one row, with the hint 'Enter para enviar \u00b7 Shift+Enter para salto de l\u00ednea' so multi-line prompts stay possible."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_kanban_board", "label": "Kanban Board", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Titled 'Tablero Kanban' with subtitle 'Gestiona y visualiza el progreso de tus tareas.' The board area uses a subtle radial purple gradient background (#EFE9FA to #F2F2F4) to separate it from the flat white side panels; header holds 'Nueva tarea' (primary), 'Filtrar' and a more menu."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_kanban_column_states", "label": "Kanban Column States", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four fixed workflow states \u2014 BACKLOG (6), POR HACER (4), EN PROGRESO (3), TERMINADO (4 visible + 'Ver m\u00e1s') \u2014 each with a colored status dot, uppercase tracking-wide title, count pill and an 'Agregar tarea' ghost row at the bottom of the column."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_task_card", "label": "Task Card", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Uniform card anatomy: title row, tag chips, meta row with priority dot + label, subtask count with checklist icon, assignee avatar; 'En progreso' cards add a progress track and 'Terminado' cards replace it with a green done badge and a 'When' timestamp \u2014 the card reveals only the metadata relevant to its state."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_task_tag_taxonomy", "label": "Task Tag Taxonomy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recurring tag vocabulary across cards: Backend, Rendimiento, Infraestructura, Datos, Testing, Documentaci\u00f3n, UI/UX, Investigaci\u00f3n, Investigadores, Bug \u2014 tinted chips per category, allowing filter-by-label in the board header."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_contexto_panel", "label": "Contexto Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Header description states the purpose: 'Informaci\u00f3n que la IA tendr\u00e1 en cuenta.' \u2014 a curated, editable bundle (project context text, rules, resources) that steers AI output instead of forcing the user to repeat context in every prompt. Sections are separated by dividers and each has its own edit/add affordance."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_reglas_a_seguir", "label": "Reglas a seguir", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Compact list of standing instructions (e.g. 'Dividir funcionalidades grandes en subtareas.') shown as check-marked rows with a 'Ver todas (7)' link and an add-rule button \u2014 persistent constraints the AI should respect when generating tasks or plans."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_recursos", "label": "Recursos", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reference list attached as AI context; each row pairs a type icon (link / Figma / file-text) with resource name and source (Documentaci\u00f3n API \u2014 docs.proyecto.com; Dise\u00f1o principal \u2014 Figma; requerimientos.pdf), plus 'Ver todos (6)'."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_plan_del_proyecto", "label": "Plan del proyecto", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Project-level companion to the task-level board (right panel, 310px, subtitle shows the project name). It stacks a tab switcher and four cards \u2014 Informaci\u00f3n general, Progreso general, Pr\u00f3ximos hitos, Plan sugerido para hoy \u2014 so scope, health and next actions are visible without leaving the board."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_plan_tabs", "label": "Plan Tabs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Segmented control inside a #F0F0F2 track with four sections \u2014 Resumen (active, white pill with shadow), Estructura, Cronograma, Notas \u2014 signalling that the plan has multiple views beyond the summary."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_card_informacion_general", "label": "Card \u2014 Informaci\u00f3n general", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Label/value stack for NOMBRE (Observatorio Regional), DESCRIPCI\u00d3N, OBJETIVO and STACK (Next.js, PostgreSQL, TypeScript chips), with an 'Editar' ghost action in the card header \u2014 the plan's editable cover sheet."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_card_progreso_general", "label": "Card \u2014 Progreso general", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One large percentage plus a caption over a progress track, followed by a distribution list with mini bars for Por hacer / En progreso / Terminado / Backlog \u2014 the same four workflow states as the board columns, re-expressed as a health summary."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_card_proximos_hitos", "label": "Card \u2014 Pr\u00f3ximos hitos", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Coarse-grained checkpoints above task level, each a name + done/total count (M\u00f3dulo de investigadores completo 3/6, Testing general de la aplicaci\u00f3n 1/8, Despliegue en producci\u00f3n 0/5) with a progress bar, plus a 'Hito' ghost add action."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_card_plan_sugerido_para_hoy", "label": "Card \u2014 Plan sugerido para hoy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each AI suggestion is a checkable row with an estimated duration chip (~30 min, ~45 min, ~40 min, ~1 h) and the card closes with '4 tareas \u00b7 Tiempo estimado \u2248 2 h 55 min' \u2014 the design answers 'what realistically fits today', not merely 'what is next'. Regenerated via the sparkles 'Generar nuevo' ghost action."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_ai_assistant_sparkles_glyph", "label": "AI Assistant (Sparkles Glyph)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The lucide 'sparkles' glyph is the repeated visual signature of AI-generated content: app logo, chat header avatar, AI message avatars, the Propuesta de tareas header, and the 'Plan sugerido para hoy' / 'Generar nuevo' actions \u2014 a single mark lets users recognise machine-generated material anywhere in the workspace."}, {"id": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_panel_collapse_controls", "label": "Panel Collapse Controls", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every side panel owns a chevron-left control \u2014 Collapse Chat, Ocultar Contexto, Collapse Plan \u2014 and the board header keeps a matching Reopen Chat button. The exported variant '03 \u00b7 Chat oculto \u2014 Kanban expandido' shows the payoff: hiding a panel widens the board, so layout is user-adjustable rather than fixed."}], "edges": [{"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_workspace", "target": "readme_workspace", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_app_sidebar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_project_selector", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_chat_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_kanban_board", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_contexto_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_03_chat_oculto_kanban_expandido", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_app_sidebar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_03_chat_oculto_kanban_expandido", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_kanban_board", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_03_chat_oculto_kanban_expandido", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_plan_del_proyecto", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_project_selector", "target": "ref_01_workspace_chat_kanban_plan_export_observatorio_regional", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ref/01 \u00b7 Workspace \u2014 Chat \u00b7 Kanban \u00b7 Plan-export.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ref